id: pm-rust-build-script-coverage
title: Exercise platform build directives in the standard LLVM coverage gate
description: "The documented all-target/all-feature LLVM command with cargo-llvm-cov 0.8.7 passes 734 tests and covers every src file at 100%, but includes unchanged build.rs and leaves its MSVC stack-directive branch uncovered. Initial global totals: lines 16889/16890, functions 1751/1751, regions 27337/27338, branches 3763/3764. Running the existing instrumented build script with synthetic GNU and MSVC target environments, asserting exact output, then regenerating the report produces 100% on all four totals without exclusions or threshold changes. Add portable platform-directive coverage to the standard aggregate gate. Synthetic directive checks do not establish actual Windows linking behavior."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 2
tags[3]: build,coverage,follow-up
